{"parse": {"title": "以骑士之名-01", "pageid": 127811, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%9B%E5%B0%94%E7%BA%B1%C2%B7%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D\" title=\"玛尔纱·以骑士之名\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">以骑士之名-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D-02\" title=\"以骑士之名-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">以骑士之名</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.A7.A3.E9.93.83.E4.BA.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"解铃人\">解铃人</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 解铃人</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">On the Inside</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_13\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312742.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312742.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我，玛尔纱·罗森哈特，在诸位骑士团同胞之前，立下誓言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312742.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312742.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我承诺忠诚顺服，放弃一切财产，与众人共同生活，彼此照顾，绝不离团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312742.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312742.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我将成为高地骑士团的捍卫者与永恒的朝圣者，虔诚贯彻骑士团所有使命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312742.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312742.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-312742.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312742.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我将毫无欺诈地履行誓言，遵循良俗章程与同胞的劝勉——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312743.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-312743.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312743.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312743.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-312743.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312743.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-312743.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312743.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>直至死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只手搭上她的肩膀，偌大的使命与责任也一同落了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">骑士团大团长：</div><div>奉主与圣母的名义，我们如此接纳你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">骑士团大团长：</div><div>我们给予你面包、清水与清贫之衣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她双手合十，等待厚重的披风覆于肩上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又有一只手搭上她的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-531810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-531810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-531810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>今天起，你正式踏上这条骑士之路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-531810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-531810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-531810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你须知，这并非荣耀而是重负，玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312740.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312740.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-312740.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312740.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>合十的手紧紧握着，直至欣喜的热汗将她的掌心沾湿。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"151\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2164\" data-file-height=\"544\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士的双手再次合十。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>罕见的和平降临在安全区内，但并未为生命的凋零画上终止符。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>战友，你们已尽了忠诚与勇气的本分，请勿惧怕黑暗，我将为你们祈祷——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你们将在平和与光明中安息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祷告结束，她睁开眼，调整了一番心绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大撤退后，有不少重伤者尽管接受了急救，但仍然没能挨过感染的侵袭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-629001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">急救站护士：</div><div>如果我们有更好的医疗条件，他们一定能活下来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>疲惫的叹息中夹杂着懊恼。玛尔纱拍了拍对方的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我们已做了能做的一切，玛格丽特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>铭记生命的重量，但不要过分苛责自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传令兵：</div><div>玛尔纱医生，刻雷乌斯长官找你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>好，我马上就去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱再次注视了一番急救站内的景象，这才转身离开。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_bangongshi\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Cg-2_6_bg_bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Cg-2_6_bg_bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Cg-2_6_bg_bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>刻雷乌斯长官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>我刚刚收到“剃刀”小队的报告，他们在靠近前线的森城遇上了一位骑士团成员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>您是说，我过去的战友吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>没错。“剃刀”试图与其接触，但对方十分排斥我们的接近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>因此，我需要你前往森城，看看问题究竟出在哪儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>如今我们暂时阻拦了重塑之手的计划，但仍需争取更多能对抗他们的力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>你的身份，能帮助基金会拉近与骑士团之间的关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>好，我会尽力的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>不过，急救站那边……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>明天开始，存活下来的伤员会陆续转移到更后方的医院。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>届时有更专业的医疗团队提供救治。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>两个小时后会有一班火车开往森城，你要尽快动身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我明白了，长官。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"151\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2164\" data-file-height=\"544\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离开办公室，骑士摸了摸手臂上的盔甲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>已经很久没有和骑士团的人见面了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫大的宽慰感涌上心头，其中还潜藏着一丝焦虑。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_chezhan1\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_chezhan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>悠扬的鸣笛声后，火车缓缓进站。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱舒缓了一下僵硬的身躯，随着人群一同下了火车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>玛尔纱，你终于来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前来接应玛尔纱的“剃刀”脸上流露出无可奈何的神情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>“剃刀”先生，现在情况怎么样了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>想必你已知道，城内这位骑士并不愿与我们交流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>更棘手的是，这里靠近重塑之手的占领区，我们目前正在疏散人群。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>这也包括了你那位骑士团的同伴，但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>她拒绝撤离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>想到那位固执的骑士，“剃刀”不免摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>她不愿撤离？原因是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>……我想只有你才能找到这个原因了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>更令人头疼的是，她执意前往重塑之手的占领区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>一个人前往占领区？这太危险了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>这也是我们的考虑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>我们清楚高地骑士团成员的本领，玛尔纱，你就是鲜明的例子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>但孤身一人遭遇重塑之手，发生意外的可能性太大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“剃刀”：</div><div>我们并不希望无谓的流血事件发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我不记得骑士团里有这么不讲理的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>应该是有一些特别的原因，才会让她这么固执。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士百思不得其解。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "以骑士之名-01"}}